    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They Come at Daylight is a narrative heavy anomaly indie horror game set in post-apocalyptic world. The game follows a group of friends, all misfits to their Community in their own ways, going on an adventure to the Zone, a forbidden area around the Community, where They roam free during the day. Fun little journey turns deadly fast when they realize they\u2019re in over their head and there\u2019s no guarantee they will make it back home safe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of two different styles of gameplay; days, where the player can move around and explore in a point-and-click style gameplay, and nights, where the game\u2019s focus is heavily on telling a story through a written narrative and frame pictures. These two parts will cycle multiple times throughout the game.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They Come at Daylight is a narrative heavy anomaly indie horror game set in post-apocalyptic world. The game follows a group of friends, all misfits to their Community in their own ways, going on an adventure to the Zone, a forbidden area around the Community, where They roam free during the day. Fun little journey turns deadly fast when they realize they\u2019re in over their head and there\u2019s no guarantee they will make it back home safe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of two different styles of gameplay; days, where the player can move around and explore in a point-and-click style gameplay, and nights, where the game\u2019s focus is heavily on telling a story through a written narrative and frame pictures. These two parts will cycle multiple times throughout the game.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "You were only supposed to go see the Ferris wheel together. One last adventure before you all grow up to become a productive part of The Community. Now you learn the hard way why The Zone is strictly forbidden. Can you make it back home?\u00a0",
